    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Trauma is one of the leading causes of death and disability not only in Pakistan, but also across the globe. Trauma cases are probably more amenable to treatment than cancer, stroke and some heart diseases, if managed appropriately. In South Asia, trauma related mortality is on the rise and according to WHO, will be the leading cause of productive life loss for both developed nations and developing nations by 2020.",
